# SparkRPGM Project Rules
- Target: iPad 9th Gen on iPadOS 15.6.1 (3 GB RAM).
- Deployment: Unsigned .ipa installed via TrollStore (built via GitHub Actions).
- Deployment Target: iOS 15.0 minimum.
- Hard API Restrictions: Strictly NO iOS 16+ or iOS 26 APIs (e.g. NavigationStack,
  .scrollContentBackground, .presentationDetents, .safeAreaInset, .foregroundStyle,
  ShareLink, AsyncImage, @Observable, View.tracking, .glassEffect()).
- Memory Budget: 3 GB device RAM. Keep file operations strictly in standard
  Documents / tmp paths with low memory overhead. Avoid large memory buffers.
- Stability: Do NOT rewrite working DocumentPicker, ArchiveExtractor, or
  RPGMSchemeHandler unless explicitly requested.
- Git Identity: Always run `git config user.email "140104071+Lohnt@users.noreply.github.com"`.
